        "slc_c7b6511dd34a37560b1582dc98f72bb32bfd2497113001279add460922c508da"
      ],
      "text": "The core is language-agnostic but TypeScript-specific references are included; other languages rely on repository-native commands until language-specific guidance is added."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
